      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Social scheduler\nDefault (`AUTOPILOT_SOCIAL_POSTING=false`): every approved draft is sent to Telegram for MANUAL posting and marked `Notification Sent`.\nAPI posting only when `AUTOPILOT_SOCIAL_POSTING=true`, `AUTOPILOT_STOP` is not true and provider settings exist (Buffer: `BUFFER_API_KEY` + `BUFFER_PROFILE_ID_<PLATFORM>`; X: `TWITTER_POSTING_ENABLED=true` + credential). A failed API post falls back to the manual alert.\nEXTERNAL DEPENDENCY: Buffer / X API access; request shapes are not verified against the live providers.",
